<title>USA: Advanced Micro Devices Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Advanced Micro Devices Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUNNYVALE, Calif., Jan. 13 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		   Dec 29 1996		Dec 31 1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.15	  profit  $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss	  21,243	 profit  9,344</p>
<p> Revs		496,868		  595,178</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  137,693		  138,941</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.51	  profit  $1.59</p>
<p> Net loss	  68,950	 profit  216,316</p>
<p> Revs		1,953,019		2,468,379</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  135,687		  136,208</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call estimate was a loss of $0.19 a share for the fourth quarter ended December 29, 1996. Q4 book-to-bill ratio exceeded 1.00 for the first time since the second quarter of 1995. Financial results for 1995 have been restated to include the historical financial information of NexGen, Inc</p>
